 "Recovery": "/implementation",
 "The order is carried out and the outcome is reported back to you at every step.": "/implementation",
 "How enforcement works": "/implementation",
 "A domestic arbitral award is enforced in the same manner as a decree of court under Section {0} of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, {1}. Foreign awards are enforced under Part II of the Act, which gives effect to the New York Convention, {2}, and awards made in India can be enforced abroad in any Convention country under that country's applicable laws. Mediated settlement agreements are enforceable under the Mediation Act, {3}, and Lok Adalat awards are deemed decrees of a civil court.": "/implementation",
